@AiGateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5207
// Paste your local Auth:MasterApiKey (from appsettings.Development.json) here — don't commit a real value.
@MasterApiKey = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_DEV_MASTER_API_KEY

### Health (no auth required)
GET {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### List keys (Administrator only — master key)
GET {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/keys
X-Api-Key: {{MasterApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a key — the returned "apiKey" value is shown once and never again
POST {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/keys
X-Api-Key: {{MasterApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Example integration",
  "responsibleName": "Jane Doe",
  "contactInfo": "jane.doe@example.com"
}

### Get a single key by id
@KeyId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/keys/{{KeyId}}
X-Api-Key: {{MasterApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Edit a key's metadata
PUT {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/keys/{{KeyId}}
X-Api-Key: {{MasterApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Example integration",
  "responsibleName": "Jane Doe",
  "contactInfo": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "expiresAt": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Rollover (rotate) a key — the returned "apiKey" value is shown once and never again
POST {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/keys/{{KeyId}}/rollover
X-Api-Key: {{MasterApiKey}}

### Deactivate a key
POST {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/keys/{{KeyId}}/deactivate
X-Api-Key: {{MasterApiKey}}

### Activate a key
POST {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/keys/{{KeyId}}/activate
X-Api-Key: {{MasterApiKey}}

### Audit log for a key
GET {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/keys/{{KeyId}}/audit-log
X-Api-Key: {{MasterApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Delete a key permanently — hard delete, cascades to its audit log and any Knowledge Base
### groups/documents/chunks created under it. Cannot be undone.
DELETE {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/Keys/Delete/{{KeyId}}
X-Api-Key: {{MasterApiKey}}

### Ollama / Speaches endpoints require any active key (Standard or Administrator)
GET {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/ollama/version
X-Api-Key: {{MasterApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Search logs (Administrator only — master key). All query params are optional.
GET {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/Logs/Search?Level=Error&Search=timeout&From=2026-07-01T00:00:00Z&Page=1&PageSize=50
X-Api-Key: {{MasterApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Knowledge Base — requires a Standard-role key (create one via POST /keys above).
### The master key is deliberately blocked from all Knowledge Base actions (403) since it has no ApiKey row to own data under.
@StandardApiKey = REPLACE_WITH_A_STANDARD_ROLE_API_KEY

### Create a knowledge group
POST {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/KnowledgeBase/CreateGroup
X-Api-Key: {{StandardApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kunde data"
}

### List my knowledge groups
GET {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/KnowledgeBase/ListGroups
X-Api-Key: {{StandardApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Delete a knowledge group (cascades to its documents/chunks)
@GroupId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
DELETE {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/KnowledgeBase/DeleteGroup/{{GroupId}}
X-Api-Key: {{StandardApiKey}}

### Upload a document (txt/md/pdf/docx) to a group — extracted, chunked, embedded, and indexed synchronously
POST {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/KnowledgeBase/UploadDocument
X-Api-Key: {{StandardApiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AiGatewayBoundary

--AiGatewayBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="GroupId"

{{GroupId}}
--AiGatewayBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="example.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is example knowledge base content used to test upload and RAG search.
--AiGatewayBoundary--

### List documents (optionally filtered by groupId)
GET {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/KnowledgeBase/ListDocuments?groupId={{GroupId}}
X-Api-Key: {{StandardApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Delete a document (and its chunks/vectors)
@DocumentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
DELETE {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/KnowledgeBase/DeleteDocument/{{DocumentId}}
X-Api-Key: {{StandardApiKey}}

### Download a document's original uploaded file
GET {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/KnowledgeBase/DownloadDocument/{{DocumentId}}
X-Api-Key: {{StandardApiKey}}

### Search for the most relevant chunks across every group/document the calling key owns — TopK is optional
POST {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/KnowledgeBase/Search
X-Api-Key: {{StandardApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What is in the example content?",
  "topK": 5
}

### Retrieval-augmented chat — same "messages" contract as Ollama/Chat (below), but retrieves context
### across every group/document the calling key owns and returns it as "sources" alongside the answer.
### Retrieval uses only the latest "user" message, never the full messages list.
POST {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/KnowledgeBase/RagChat
X-Api-Key: {{StandardApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "llama3.2",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "What is in the example content?" }
  ],
  "topK": 5
}

### Retrieval-augmented chat, turn 2 — the caller resends the full conversation each turn (the server
### holds no conversation state), appending the previous call's "message" as an assistant turn.
### Retrieval for this call is still based only on the newest "user" message, not earlier turns.
POST {{AiGateway_HostAddress}}/KnowledgeBase/RagChat
X-Api-Key: {{StandardApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "llama3.2",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "What is in the example content?" },
    { "role": "assistant", "content": "<paste the previous call's \"message.content\" here>" },
    { "role": "user", "content": "And how does that compare to last month?" }
  ],
  "topK": 5
}
